## A2 — Decision-Aligned Evaluation Memo (Week 4)

**Purpose:** Evaluate systems using costs and consequences, not accuracy alone.

### What to Submit
- 1–2 page PDF memo
- Sections: Decision, Stakeholder, Error Types, Cost Model, Metrics, Plan
- One diagram or table mapping errors → costs

### Grading (100 pts)

| Category | Points | Expectations |
|--------|------|-------------|
| Decision–cost alignment | 40 | Explicit cost model tied to decision |
| Evaluation logic | 30 | Metrics beyond accuracy |
| Clarity | 20 | Well-structured, concise |
| Evidence | 10 | At least one credible citation |

### Credible Help Resources
- NIST AI RMF: https://www.nist.gov/itl/ai-risk-management-framework

