## A3 — MVP Build (Week 6)

**Purpose:** Demonstrate an end-to-end decision-support system.

### What to Submit
- Runnable notebook (Colab or .ipynb)
- ½–1 page operator playbook

### Grading (100 pts)

| Category | Points | Expectations |
|--------|------|-------------|
| End-to-end functionality | 40 | Runs cleanly, reproducible |
| Decision relevance | 30 | Clear action/threshold |
| Explanation | 20 | Playbook + failure modes |
| Code quality | 10 | Clean, readable |

### Credible Help Resources
- OpenAI Cookbook: https://cookbook.openai.com/
- LangChain Docs: https://docs.langchain.com/

